# Project Overview

This repository contains the Ultraterrestrial Resurrection project, a Next.js application focused on UFO sightings, historical events, and data visualization.

## Project Structure

- [package.json](mdc:package.json) - Main package configuration
- [apps/app/](mdc:apps/app) - Main Next.js application
- [apps/agent-ui/](mdc:apps/agent-ui) - Agent UI application
- [apps/cli/](mdc:apps/cli) - CLI tools
- [apps/disclosure-rag/](mdc:apps/disclosure-rag) - Disclosure RAG system
- [packages/](mdc:packages) - Shared packages and libraries

## Key Directories

- `apps/app/src/app` - Next.js app router pages
- `apps/app/src/components` - Core components, compositions and visual elements of the application
- `apps/app/src/components/ui` - UI components
- `apps/app/src/features` - Feature modules
- `apps/app/src/services` - Backend services
- `apps/app/src/lib` - Third party installations, packages and libraries (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.)
- `packages/knowledge-base` - Knowledge base resources
